{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/50","id":4535898938,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUaKq7M8AAAABDlxTOg","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/50","diff_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/50.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pull/50.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/50","number":50,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[M5.2] 精确范围本地检索与读取、推荐恢复修复","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"本地检索按用户明确选定的精确块、小节或课程范围运行。索引缺失时通过真实 Job 构建，命中保留完整正文、来源、修订和哈希；浏览器恢复后继续回读原命令与当前任务，旧范围不静默迁移到新版本。\n\n本次补充三项有实际反例的回归修复：Policy 慢轮询响应可恢复可用状态；推荐首次可用点击不会被迟到的 effect 清理取消；推荐维护确认无需更新时使用只读事务，避免空闲检查占据 writer 锁。需要更新时仍在原写事务完整重核最新 Policy、历史和输入。Content/Reader 的排他权限与完整性检查、原 Reader 5 秒断言保持不变。\n\n验证代码：`d65e08e3c3fd896896f7228f6099ef93b9c3362d`，唯一规范 PRODUCT_DESIGN.md 3.0.3。\n\n- 该固定代码新运行完整 Python：1673 PASS / 2 依赖警告（291.76s）；真实浏览器：88 PASS（7.4m）；Ruff、mypy133、规范自检通过。787 输入前后绑定，native 唯一已知测试输出截图变化被原样记录、归档后精确恢复，原 unchanged=false 保留。\n- c83 前端完整 355 项测试、lint/typecheck/build 通过；与本次代码的前端输入相同关系单独核验，未声称重跑。\n- 推荐维护同一最终测试字节在旧逻辑下 3 FAIL、修复后 3 PASS；新旧相关集成测试 39 PASS。来源并发更新、独立测验权限、另一 worker 抢先完成、失败重试和未知错误都有负控。源码与原始日志接受独立审查。\n- 既有固定原创检索基准为 30 块、42 条 gold；两轮各 38 正向 Recall@5=1.0，4 无匹配通过。该小型词法基准不证明通用 RAG、模型回答质量或学习效果。\n\n当前远端验收仍失败：发布 ab6c27b 的 push34968882564 / PR34968887070 最终 11 success / 1 failure。PR 浏览器88 PASS（12.5m），push浏览器87 PASS / 1 FAIL（13.6m）；后者在 reader.spec.ts:209 私有原件用例的导入前置，:216 等待未出现对话框时耗尽整条60秒预算，未进入上传/撤权/下载断言。实际截图与 error-context 已保留，无本用例网络JSON。独立只读审查定位到 Shell 导入入口的策略拒绝分支，但点击时为何受限尚待受控实验；没有新修复或全绿结论。12个原日志实际checkout/tree逐项核验，推送与PR的commit不同、tree相同。\n\n历史 CI 失败保留：3dd 两个浏览器任务失败；73d 双工作流最终 10 success / 2 failure（push 推荐前端、PR历史Reader）。73d 实际 Reader 失败附件显示小节和目录 GET 在观察期未完成；具体延迟层与唯一原因仍未确定。累计合成库中的写锁等待是独立实测机制，不追认为 CI 秒级超时的唯一原因。\n\n详细证据与输入边界见 progress/M5.2-next.md、M5.2-ab6-ci 与 M5.2-ab6-import-opening-review。当前/下一主要任务仍M5.2，后续仅证据检查点提交不算修复，其新CI另按实际head读回。保留原失败、测试脚本修正、已知测试输出截图变化及早期附件丢失事实。\n\n依赖未合并 PR #49；本 PR 保持 draft/open，不自动合并或关闭任务。M5.3 Tutor/Run/Agent 尚未实现，独立供应商最小接口测试成功与平台 Agent 验收分开记录；真实凭据和个人资料未加入仓库或 CI。\n\nRefs #27\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T10:23:58Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T12:58:16Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"833744497a2bee1d30bfa0f0ccbf269c4114d130","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/50/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/50/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/50/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/statuses/0484a4ccea8b0dcb17c87743dc512b78e5633dd5","head":{"label":"kl3574:feat/M5.2-local-retrieval","ref":"feat/M5.2-local-retrieval","sha":"0484a4ccea8b0dcb17c87743dc512b78e5633dd5","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI